// Requirements

1. User should be able to searach book by title
2. User should be able to filter book by subject // physics , hindi , math
3. User should be able to view books details
4. User should be able to issue a available book 
5. User should be able to return a book and system should check if fine applicable.
6. System should be able to generate a token with user details , book details  , issue date , return date , fine amount , transaction id
7. User should be able to login

// Non Functional Requirement

1. It should follow solid principles
2. Design should be modular and easy to maintian
3. it should be extensible to add more feature like payment strategy etc
4. Components should have low coupling and high cohension


